    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. The beguiling\naroma of this incense may cause attacks to miss\nits holder.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "持たせると　御香の　不思議な\n香りが　相手を　まどわせて\n技が　命中　しにくくなる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "携带后，薰香的\n神奇香气会迷惑对手，\n其招式会变得不容易命中。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Debe llevarlo un Pokémon. Su peculiar aroma reduce la\nPrecisión del objetivo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
